 detecting and correcting errors\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":168,"row":{"pair_id":"16273479#8370171","label":1,"id_left":16273479,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":11915959,"brand_left":"\"GoPro\"@us","title_left":" \" GoPro The Handler (Floating Hand Grip) \"@us","description_left":" \"GoPro The Handler (Floating Hand Grip)\"@us","price_left":"\"34.99\"@us, \"USD\"@us","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8370171,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":11915959,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"GoPro Floating Hand Grip Action Camera Mount\"@en Mount LN68139 - AFHGM-001 | SCAN UK\"@en","description_right":"\"GoPro Floating Hand Grip, Floats in water, With integrated wrist strap          \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":169,"row":{"pair_id":"3189185#10010468","label":0,"id_left":3189185,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":70116,"brand_left":"\"Transcend\"","title_left":" \"Transcend 16GB SDHC Class 10 Flash Memory Card Up to 30MB/s (TS16GSDHC10)\" \"Digital Camera Accessories | All Tech Toys\"","description_left":"\"Transcend 16GB Class 10 SDHC Flash Memory Card (TS16GSDHC10E) - Frustration Free Package Certified Frustration Free Packaging Amazon.com has certified this product's packaging is Frustration Free. A Frustration Free Package is easy-to-open and comes without excess packaging materials such as hard plastic \"clamshell\" casings, plastic bindings, and wire ties. It is exactly the same as a traditionally packaged product we've just streamlined the packaging to be opened without the use of a box cutter or knife and will protect your product just as well as traditional packaging during shipping. Products with Frustration-Free Packaging can frequently be shipped in their own boxes, without the need for an additional shipping box.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10010468,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":7662050,"brand_right":"\"Transcend\"","title_right":" \"Transcend 32 GB Class 10 SDHC Flash Memory Card (TS32GSDHC10E)\" \"Camera & Photo Accessories - Page 3 | All Tech Toys\"","description_right":"\"Transcend TS32GSDHC10 Secure Digital High Capacity (SDHC) TS32GSDHC10 Flash Memory\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":170,"row":{"pair_id":"7158075#11610687","label":0,"id_left":7158075,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":14955088,"brand_left":"\"Kupo\"@en","title_left":" \"Kupo 40\" Black Extension Grip Arm\"@en Arm KG203511 - Filmtools\"@en","description_left":"\"\n 2 1/2-inch grip head \nMounted on the end of a 40-inch steel bar\nDiameter of 5/8-inches\nRough non-slip surface\nAluminum and steel construction \nBlack powder coated finish\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Specifications Length 42.75 in (108.58 cm) Width 6.19 in (15.72 cm) Height 2.5 in (6.35 cm) Weight 3.13 lbs (1.42 kg) Primary Material Black Aluminium/Aluminium Secondary Material Black Powder Coated Steel Bar/Steel Bar Minimum Jaw Diameter 0.25 in (6.35 mm) Maximum Jaw Diameter 0.62 in (16 mm)","id_right":11610687,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":1763596,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Oregon PowerNow B600E 40-Volt 4.0Ah Lithium-Ion Battery Pack\"@en 548208","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":171,"row":{"pair_id":"7366255#7799521","label":1,"id_left":7366255,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":9309675,"brand_left":"\"Veho\"@en-US","title_left":" \"Veho VCC-005-MUVI-NPNG MUVI HD Mini Handsfree ActionCam with Waterproof Case and 8 GB Memory - No Proof Glory Edition\"@en-US \"Camcorders Page 3 | Come As You Arts\"@en-US","description_left":"\"Veho are pleased to announce the partnership with new and exciting lifestyle and action sports media partner No Proof No Glory . As part of this partnership, Veho have released the MUVI HD Special Edition No Proof No Glory' Bundle. The Special Edition No Proof No Glory MUVI HD includes a Waterproof Case that is capable of depths of 60 Meters underwater for a full 60 minutes, a Helmet Front Mount that allows you to create a true POV angle when filming hands free.The MUVI HD has updated firmware to allow you to record at 960p at 30fps and 720p at 60 & 30fps giving you more versatility with your MUVI HD action camera. The MUVI HD also has a 16mbit/s in 1080p mode to make sure your footage is as smooth as possible. The 1400 mAh battery has the biggest capacity on the market and will give your MUVI HD a continuous 3 hours recording time. The No Proof No Glory edition also ships with a 8 GB micro SD card which will enable around 80 minutes at full 1080p high definition. With a host of other features such as Time Lapse continuous photos, exposure control, touch sensitive controls, remote control, 1.5-Inch LCD and many more, you wont want to use any other action camera. Other accessories as are also available for the MUVI HD such as the Duo pod, headband mount and Harness mount.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7799521,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":9309675,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Veho VCC-005 MUVI HD NPNG Body Camera/Action Camcorder Special Edition\"@en \" Consumer Video Cameras | Unique Photo \"@en","description_right":"\"\n\tHD video at 30fps & Up to 8MP Stills\n\t170 degree wide angle lens\n\tIncludes a waterproof case: Up to 60m for 60 mins\n\tRechargable li-ion battery up to 3hrs recording\n\tIncludes 8GB Micro SD card (up to 32GB)\n\t1.5 inch viewfinder/review LCD, Touch panel control\n\tSelf timer, digital zoom and noise activation\n\tUniversal mounting options\n\tStandard tripod Mount\n\tOptional date and time stamp\n\tDimensions (W x H x D): 47 x 80 x 19 mm\n\tWeight: 81 g\n\n\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":172,"row":{"pair_id":"4108031#9805670","label":1,"id_left":4108031,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":5859797,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Manfrotto Pro Backpack 30 \"@en - Optics4Birding","description_left":"\"\n                            The Manfrotto Pro Backpack 30 conveniently carries two DSLR bodies, one with a 70-200 f/2.8 zoom lens attached, three more lenses, and a flash organized between padded dividers in the main compartment. It also has a dedicated pocket for a 13\" laptop at the back, and a padded zippered pocket for a tablet on the inside of the front flap. For quick access to your gear, the front flap opens all the way down to reveal the main compartment. For further convenience, the Pro Backpack features numerous exterior and interior pockets.  Made from water-repellent Cordura nylon, this Pro bag features a multi-layered construction and a front shield that, along with four shock-absorbing feet, better diverts impact away from the middle of the bag. For further impact protection, the Pro bag features red rigid padded interior dividers that are built to withstand impact within the middle of the bag and maintain the interior shape.  For convenience when traveling, there is a nylon-webbed trolley strap at the back. For carrying the bag, there is a detachable adjustable shoulder harness with an included waist belt and sternum strap, and a grab handle at the top. Additionally, a removable rain cover is included for inclement weather.\n                        \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9805670,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":5859797,"brand_right":"\"Manfrotto\"@en","title_right":" \"Manfrotto Pro Backpack 30 DSLR Camera Bag\"@en Bag MB MP-BP-30BB - Filmtools\"@en","description_right":"\"\nFor 2 DSLRs,Grip,70-200, 3 Lenses, Flash\nAccommodates 13\" Laptop & Tablet\nMulti-Layered Impact Protection\nRigid Padded Interior Dividers\nWater-Repellent Cordura Nylon\nFront & Side Tripod Attachments\nTwo QR Belts for Securing Tripods\nRear Trolley Sleeve\nRemovable Rain Cover\n\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":173,"row":{"pair_id":"651349#7914555","label":1,"id_left":651349,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":1145567,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" NEW! LUMIX® DMC-TS20 16.1 Megapixel Digital Camera \"@en, DMC-TS20A \"@en \"Panasonic Product Support - DMC-TS20A\"@en","description_left":"\"\nFeatures\n\n16ft Waterproof, 5ft Shockproof, 14°F Freezeproof, Dustproof\nHD Video Recording in MP4 Format\nMega O.I.S. (Optical Image Stabilizer)\n\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7914555,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":1145567,"brand_right":"\"Panasonic\"@en-US","title_right":" \"Panasonic Lumix TS20 16.1 MP TOUGH Waterproof Digital Camera with 4x Optical Zoom (Blue) (OLD MODEL)\"@en-US \"Cameras | EISF\"@en-US","description_right":"\"DCAM Lumix 16.1MP Waterproof Red The Panasonic LUMIX TS20 digital camera, which features a rugged design allowing for it to be waterproof to approximately 16 feet (5 meters), shockproof to approximately 5 feet (1.5 meters), dustproof and freezeproof to temperatures as low as 14Â§F. The LUMIX TS20 (16.1-megapixel) features a flat and slim profile with a 25mm ultra-wide-angle lens and a 4x optical zoom (35mm\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":174,"row":{"pair_id":"3705669#16481196","label":0,"id_left":3705669,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":1583600,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Fujifilm Fujinon XF 55-200mm f3.5-4.8 R LM OIS Lens\"@en Aden Camera \"@en \" Fujifilm Lens | Digital SLR Toronto Canada Store Cameras","description_left":"\"\n                        ** For purchase inquires, please call 416-977-9711 or email us at in